==Trivia==
* If the player enters Mor Ul Rek via the volcano with [[Karamjan rum]] in their inventory, it will explode due to the heat, dealing 1 damage per rum in the inventory.
** Rum that was smuggled out via other methods can be safely taken out of either of the banks inside Mor Ul Rek without exploding. Only entering from the volcano entrance will cause the rum to explode.

